  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tuberculosis - Turkmenistan (01-Jul-2016-30-Jun-2018)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Turkmenistan, Tuberculosis, United Nations Development Programme (UNDP Turkmenistan)This program has the following goals: To decrease the burden of tuberculosis in Turkmenistan by ensuring universal access to timely and quality diagnosis and treatment of drug-resistant forms of tuberculosis. The objectives of this program are: To ensure universal access to early and quality diagnosis of all forms of Tuberculosis.  To ensure universal access to quality patient-centered treatment of all forms of Tuberculosis.  To strenghten the program management, M&amp;E and improve the health system&apos;s performance for effective Tuberculosis control</narrative>
  </description>
